{"3368150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Saltwater Bodies", "steam_appid": 3368150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saltwater Bodies is a cave-diving body horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore underwater cave systems beneath a salt flat, and nurture an unnatural vessel away from prying eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features a physics-based caving system where you have to be mindful of positioning your body parts, and balance that against holding your breath underwater - Is it worth breathing out precious air to squeeze through a smaller gap?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside of underwater caves you can socialize with co-workers and perform arcane experiments to construct yourself a new vessel. A branching narrative that depends on how you balance your day job and your more supernatural contracts...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses a retro style with vertex wobble and a lowered resolution. These can be adjusted in the settings if it's not your jam!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saltwater Bodies is a cave-diving body horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore underwater cave systems beneath a salt flat, and nurture an unnatural vessel away from prying eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features a physics-based caving system where you have to be mindful of positioning your body parts, and balance that against holding your breath underwater - Is it worth breathing out precious air to squeeze through a smaller gap?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside of underwater caves you can socialize with co-workers and perform arcane experiments to construct yourself a new vessel. A branching narrative that depends on how you balance your day job and your more supernatural contracts...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses a retro style with vertex wobble and a lowered resolution. These can be adjusted in the settings if it's not your jam!</p>", "short_description": "A cave-diving body horror game", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368150/header.jpg?t=1782947886", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368150/ab2d1f0b2150fbd5dd6ee41552ce67bff6b4a9b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782947886", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368150/ab2d1f0b2150fbd5dd6ee41552ce67bff6b4a9b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782947886", "website": "https://saltwater-bodi.es/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8GHz Dualcore<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i5 @ 2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 2080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Semble Knights"], "publishers": ["Semble Knights"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail